- content_for :page_title do
  Feedback

%h2.no-topping Feedback

-# After a submission the form is replaced by a thank-you. The two outcomes
-# differ only in whether the relay to Google was confirmed (see
-# HomeController#submit_feedback); "emailed" also explains the detour.
- if params[:sent]
  - emailed = params[:sent] == 'emailed'
  %p
    %strong
      = emailed ? 'Thank you — your feedback has been received.' : 'Thank you — your response has been recorded.'
  - if emailed
    %p
      Our connection to the response system hiccuped, so your submission was
      delivered directly to college staff by email instead. There's nothing
      more you need to do.
  %p= link_to 'Back to the homepage', root_path
- else
  %p
    We'd love to hear your thoughts about the college — what we're doing well, and what we could do better.

  %p
    We take reports against individuals very seriously. We do not consider such reports made anonymously, however all reports will be treated confidentially, with access limited to staff and faculty members only. You may like to review our #{link_to "exclusion policy", "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sJESDvuz-M9hUeuUs-8SJrrp21afWRaYHQpYBFaJTEc"}. All submissions are subject to our #{link_to "data protection policy", "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Qo-agksXX9kprEHmUvRogCZEeBGFccqMYJKNfaA_zO0"}.

  -# Presents the feedback Google Form's questions natively; the controller
  -# relays submissions to Google server-side (see HomeController#submit_feedback,
  -# which also documents how to update the field mapping if the form changes).
  = form_tag feedback_path, id: 'feedback-form' do
    .form-group
      = label_tag :name, 'Your name'
      = text_field_tag :name, nil, required: true, autocomplete: 'name'
    .form-group
      = label_tag :contact, 'Your contact details (e.g. email)'
      = text_field_tag :contact, nil, required: true, autocomplete: 'email'
    .form-group
      = label_tag :incident, 'Time and date of incident, if applicable'
      = datetime_field_tag :incident
    .form-group
      = label_tag :feedback, 'Your feedback'
      %span.help-block Please be as detailed as you can. If your submission is long, you may wish to draft it elsewhere and then copy and paste it here.
      = text_area_tag :feedback, nil, rows: 10, required: true
    .form-group
      = submit_tag 'Submit Feedback'
